cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this colouring, please cite the paper R(12,12) ≥ 1661 by extending the Mathon–Shearer coloring (Hexagon preprint hexagon:2611.00248), together with Tatarevic's paper, r1212-1642 and r1212-1658. To cite the colouring, the programs or the Lean proof themselves, cite this repository by its Zenodo DOI."
title: "R(12,12) ≥ 1661: a colouring of K_1660, a Lean proof and computer checks"
